<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="toc2">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili luno luguhi lwa Filimoni lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo (1:1). Paulo kalwandika lupwilili luno kipigiti viyakalile mkifungo, nhegulo yake siku kalwandika lupwilili luno kipigiti viyakalile Loma. Kamba kakala yalwandike lupwilili luno kipigiti viyakalile Loma, basi vodahika lwandikigwa mkipigiti cha milao ya 61 songela kuvumbuka kwa Kilisto, kipigiti viyandike lupwilili lwa Wakolosai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo kamwandikila lupwilili luno munhu yokemigwa Filimoni. Filimoni kakala mmwanza wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto na vivija kakala na nyakadala. Paulo kamwandikila Filimoni yomulongela kamba sambiyamsune nyakadala wake Onesimo, ayo yakalile yamkimbile. Kulingana na malagizo ga Kiloma, Filimoni kakala na udaho wa kumkoma Onesimo. Paulo kakala na mbuli za kuhembekeza za kutenda Filimoni yamtogole Onesimo kamba ndugu, kwavija kamtogola Kilisto na hata kongeza kamba Onesimo yalekigwe yasang'hanike hamoja na Paulo (1:13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo komulamsa Filimoni (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho Paulo koiyalala sama ya Onesimo kamba Filimoni yamtogole Onesimo kamba ndugu yamtogole Kilisto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:4-21">1:4-21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Paulo komambukiza mkuilonga sulukila yake ya kuwatembelela na kuwalamsa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="PHM 1:22-25">1:22-25</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mfungigwa sama ya kuupeta Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto Yesu, na lolawa ha ndugu yetu Timoteo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Nomwandikila Filimoni, mbwiga wetu mnogelwa na msang'hana mietu, <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>na Afia lumbu jetu, na Alikipo asikali mietu mnhamanila, na wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, awo woiting'hana mng'anda yenu.<verse eid="PHM 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Noge na Nhamanila ya Filimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Ndugu yangu Filimoni, mazua gose nihatambika, nokutambula gweye na kumuheweza Mulungu wangu, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>kwavija nidihulika noge jako ha wanhu wose wa Mulungu na nhamanila yuulinayo mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Notambika kamba uhamoja wetu na gweye kamba wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wokugwelela ilimu ng'hulu ng'hani ya motelo zose zitulinazo ziyatugwelele Kilisto. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Ndugu yangu, noge jako dingwelela ndeng'ha ng'hulu na kunigangamiza, kwavija unovu wako uisuluza mioyo ya wanhu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Komtambikila Onesimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Mkilamso kino, nie kamba ndugu yako mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, nodaha kukushulutiza bila kudumba utende gaja golondigwa kutendeka. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Ila nokuyalalila kwavija nikunogela. Na nie, Paulo, notenda vino kamba m'vyele, na vivija sambi na mfungigwa sama ya Kilisto Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Nokuyalalila sama ya mwanangu Onesimo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Onesimo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dijo twaga da Kigiliki, nhegulo yake </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kalumba.</char></note> ayo yagaluke mwanangu wa muloho kipigiti vinikalile mkifungo. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Umwaka kakala halumbile kumwako, ila sambi kalumba kumwetu tweye tose.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Kum'bweza Onesimo kumwako konitenda nie niwe na giogio kulu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Nilonda kumsigaza hano yakale hamoja na nie, kipigiti vinili mkifungo sama ya Usenga Unogile, giladi heyo yasole hanhu hako ha kunitaza nie. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Ila silondile kutenda kinhu chochose bila kulonda gweye mwenyego, giladi kinhu chochose kinogile chuutenda, utende mkulonda mwenyego na sio mkushulutizwa.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Siku kino kicho kilamso cha Onesimo kuinega na gweye mkipigiti kidodo giladi ukale nayo mazua gose, <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>sio kamba nyakadala, ila kazama ng'hani kubanza nyakadala, kwavija heyo ndugu mnogelwa, ng'haning'hani kumwangu nie. Sambi kolumba ng'hani kumwako gweye, kamba munhu na kamba ndugu mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa.<verse eid="PHM 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Avo, ihawa konipeta nie kamba miyago, m'bokele heyo kamba vija vuuhanibokele nie. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Kamba kakutendela gehile, ama komuwila kinhu chochose, nie nokuliha. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Nie, Paulo, nokwandika mbuli ino na mkono wangu mwenyego, nie nokuliha. Ila sambiuisemwe kamba koniwila ugima wako. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Avo, ndugu yangu, unitendele mbuli ino sama ya Mndewa. Gweye kamba ndugu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, usuluze moyo wangu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Nokwandika lupwilili luno, kuno nitamanila kamba kotenda vija vinikulongela na hata kubanziliza. <verse eid="PHM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Kinhu kimwe kisigala. Nitandile gati da wahenza, kwavija notamanila kamba Mulungu kozidika nhambiko zenu na konitenda nie nibweleganye kumwenu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa za Kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Epafla, mfungigwa miyangu sama ya Kilisto Yesu, kokulamsa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Na Maluko, Alistaliko, Dema, na Luka, wasang'hana wayangu vivija wokulamsa.<verse eid="PHM 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Ngekewa ya Mndewa Yesu Kilisto iwe hamoja na loho zenu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
